  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "The vector $z$ has magnitude $2.$ What is $z\\times z?$",
  "worked_solution": "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a\u2225b.$\n\nNotice that any vector is parallel to itself. So, we have $z\u2225z.$\n\nTherefore, $z\\times z=0.$",
